All six C functions — [38;5;10mcbNorm[0m, [38;5;10mcbRemoveGammaRGB[0m, the [38;5;10mTritanopia[0m matrix, [38;5;10mcbApplyGammaRGB[0m, [38;5;10mcbDenorm[0m, and the public [38;5;10mtritanopia[0m — plus both structs. The five [38;5;10mstatic[0m helpers stay private in Rust, matching the C.[0m[0m
