Three details drove the fidelity work, and I confirmed each against the disassembly of the reference [38;5;10m.so[0m rather than reasoning from the source alone:[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mFloat/double promotion.[22m The gamma functions compare [38;5;10mfloat[0m channels against [38;5;10mdouble[0m literals and do the whole computation in [38;5;10mdouble[0m before an explicit narrowing cast. The disassembly confirms this ([38;5;10mcvtss2sd[0m, [38;5;10mcomisd[0m, [38;5;10mdivsd[0m, then [38;5;10mcvtsd2ss[0m), so the Rust promotes to [38;5;10mf64[0m and back at exactly the same points. The matrix multiply, by contrast, is pure [38;5;10mf32[0m ([38;5;10mmulss[0m/[38;5;10maddss[0m), and stays [38;5;10mf32[0m.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mThe truncating cast is the one real trap.[22m [38;5;10mcbDenorm[0m does [38;5;10m(unsigned char)(channel * 255.f + 0.5f)[0m, and the tritanopia matrix legitimately pushes channels outside [38;5;10m0..1[0m — input [38;5;10m(0,0,255)[0m yields about [38;5;10m-419.2[0m. C leaves this undefined, but GCC emits [38;5;10mcvttss2si[0m into a 32-bit register and then reads the low byte, i.e. truncate toward zero and [3mwrap[23m to 8 bits, giving [38;5;10m93[0m. Rust's [38;5;10mas u8[0m saturates and would have returned [38;5;10m0[0m. I spelled out the two steps explicitly in [38;5;10mc_float_to_uchar[0m, including the [38;5;10m0x8000_0000[0m indefinite value for NaN and out-of-i32-range inputs.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[1mCoefficient pairs that look different but aren't.[22m [38;5;10m0.12739886310880f[0m and [38;5;10m0.12739886341072f[0m differ by 3e-10, well below [38;5;10mf32[0m spacing at that magnitude, so they round to the same float — GCC shares one constant for both. I kept both literals as written; the behaviour follows automatically.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
I preserved the original's structure rather than tidying it: [38;5;10mTritanopia[0m snapshots all three inputs into locals before writing any output (so later rows see pre-update values), and no clamping was added anywhere.[0m[0m
